 THERE ONCE WAS A GIRL NAMED IRENE,
 WHO LIVED ON DISTILLED KEROSENE,
      BUT SHE STARTED ABSORBIN'
      A NEW HYDROCARBON,
 AND SINCE THEN HAS NEVER BENZENE.
